The licence texts of the libraries the core is built from, copied from each
one's pinned release tarball (waterbox/deps.lock; Mesa: setup-mesa.sh) on
2026-11-03, so that the repository carries them and the package does
(package-licenses.json names each one):

  zlib-LICENSE                zlib 1.3.2 (Zlib)
  libpng-LICENSE              libpng 1.6.59 (libpng-2.0)
  libjpeg-turbo-LICENSE.md    libjpeg-turbo 3.2.1 (BSD-3-Clause and Zlib)
  libjpeg-turbo-README.ijg    libjpeg-turbo 3.2.1: the IJG licence of its
                              libjpeg API (LICENSE.md points to it)
  freetype-LICENSE.TXT        FreeType 2.15.0: which licences it offers
  freetype-FTL.TXT            FreeType 2.15.0: the FreeType License, the one
                              of its two licences the core takes it under
  fribidi-COPYING             FriBidi 1.0.18 (LGPL-2.1-or-later)
  libogg-COPYING              libogg 1.3.6 (BSD-3-Clause)
  libvorbis-COPYING           libvorbis 1.3.7 (BSD-3-Clause)
  flac-COPYING.Xiph           libFLAC 1.5.0 (BSD-3-Clause)
  libtheora-COPYING           libtheora 1.2.0 (BSD-3-Clause)
  libtheora-LICENSE           libtheora 1.2.0: On2's statement on its patents
  libmad-COPYING              libmad 0.16.5 (GPL-2.0-or-later)
  libmad-COPYRIGHT            libmad 0.16.5: its copyright notice
  faad2-COPYING               FAAD2 2.11.4 (GPL-2.0-or-later)
  libmpeg2-COPYING            libmpeg2 0.5.1 (GPL-2.0-or-later)
  giflib-COPYING              giflib 6.1.3 (MIT)
  mesa-license.rst            Mesa 24.0.9 (MIT, with the other licences of
                              its parts listed)
